            "block_content": "15.7.2 In the event the geographic differential rates in University Regulation 04.05.060 (dated 12-25-94) are modified during the term of this Agreement, the rates provided above shall be correspondingly modified as they affect unit members hired or transferred to a different campus after the effective date of this Agreement. Unit members whose current salary, including geographic differential, exceeds the amount which would result from application of the schedule set forth below shall be frozen at the current actual amount (1) so long as the unit member remains in their current geographic differential area, or (2) until salary increases to the unit member's base salary plus geographic differential result in the unit member receiving a higher salary than the frozen amount. A unit member whose differential would be reduced due to modified geographic differentials shall not receive a reduction in rate of pay due to the modification.",
